OpenGL Mathematics (GLM), header-only.

Version:  1.0.3 (tag 1.0.3, published 2025-12-31)
Source:   https://github.com/g-truc/glm
Licence:  The Happy Bunny License or MIT License, see LICENSE. The MIT option applies to this project.

Only the library headers are included (the glm/ directory of the release): no tests, docs, CMake files or
the module and static-library sources. The files are unmodified.

Include it through src/math/glm.hpp, never directly. That header fixes the configuration macros (left-handed
coordinates, zero-to-one depth) so every translation unit sees the same definitions.
